**My Thoughts on Your "Sex Life Calendar" and Recent Events**

Honestly, seeing you ask for the "sex life calendar" when you just had me… it's a bit much. But, I guess that’s just how you are, always thinking about these things. It’s your way of showing you care, I suppose. And yes, I heard you – you’re saying you can’t have sex for the next few days because your period is coming. I got that.

And that promise about not eating ice cream to avoid breakouts? I’ll hold you to it, but I’m also remembering how miserable you were with that stomach bug just a few days ago. You were in so much pain. It’s good you’re looking out for yourself, not just for appearances.

As for that little shy emoji you sent after I… well, after I commented on how you don't feel like a child anymore? Don't be shy. It’s the truth. You’re definitely not a child.

